gulations of Four Year Under Graduate Programmes (FYUGP) in Choice Based Credit System (CBCS), 2023\nOur Publications:\n'অংকুৰ' ২০২৩, অসমীয়া বিভাগৰ প্ৰাচীৰ পত্ৰিকা (স্নাতক মহলা)\n'মেঘমল্লাৰ' ২০২৩, অসমীয়া বিভাগৰ হাতেলিখা কাব্যালোচনী\nএকবিংশ শতিকাৰ প্ৰেক্ষাপটত অসমীয়া ভাষা সাহিত্য-সংস্কৃতি\n'বৰ্ণিকা' ২০২৩, প্ৰস্তাৱনা সংখ্যা, অসমীয়া বিভাগৰ প্ৰাচীৰ পত্ৰিকা (স্নাতকোত্তৰ মহলা)\nপানচৈ 'PANCHOI' Vol.X, Issue-I, August 2022. ISSN: 2320-6306\nপানচৈ 'PANCHOI' Vol.VII, Issue-I, 2013-2014. ISSN: 2320-6306\nResults:\nResult 2009 to 2019, Department of Assamese\nAlumini Details:\nEnroll as an Alumini\nAlumini Name\nEnroll Year\nPassing Year\nActivities\nNotice\nGallery\nContact\nDepartment Activities:\nDepartment Notices:\nOur Programs and Curriculum\nTeacher-students exchange program 27th April, 2023\nView All\nGuest Lecture Programme. 29th May, 2023\nView All\nGuest Lecture Programme, 28th May, 2022\nView All\nField Study. Karbi Anglang. 3rd April, 2023\nView All\nDepartment Seminar. 23rd November, 2022\nView All\nTeacher Exchange Programme. 19 May, 2023\nView All\nPG Verification, Assamese, 1st June, 2022\nView All\nDepartment Seminar, Assamese, 19th May, 2023\nView All\nField Study and MOU 8th Feb, 2021 (Karbi Anglong)\nView All\nNational Seminar 28th & 29th Oct, 2022\nView All\nCollege Week 2022-2023 (5th to 11th April, 2023 )\nView All\nFarewell Meeting to BA 6th Sem 20-23, 6th May,2023\nView All\nGuest Lecture Programme, 17th January, 2024\nView All\nResearch Project Presentation 17th May, 2025\nView All\nTeacher Exchange Programme. 17 May, 2025\nView All\nGuest Lecture Programme. 20th March, 2025\nView All\nInternational Mother Language day 12th Feb, 2025\nView All\nTeacher Student Exchange Programme 11th Feb, 2025\nView All\n(MoU) 09th Feb, 2025\nView All\nField Study FYUGP 2nd Semester Students\nView All\nReleasing the 13th issue of  'PANCOI' 30th Oct '25\nView All\nEducational Excursion to Kaziranga  12 Feb, 2026\nView All\nInternational Mother Language Day 21 Feb, 2026\